    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaranyak le Nkaji e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Daudi o lelo kituaak le nkisiayiare neiteng'el kulikae te nkaraki enkisiaayiare embata oo layiok le Asaf le Heman o le Yedutum, laa ninche apa ooibonisho too lwululi loo usin, o too nkai oosinkolioitin, o too nkinantani dapashi. Ore lelo ootaasa esiaai enkisiaayiare enye naa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Asaf, naa, Sekur, o Yosef, o Natania, o Aharela, lelo ayiok le Asaf te utaroto e Asaf, laa ninye apa oibonisho te utaroto o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Yedutum naa Gedalia, o Seri, o Yeshaia, o Shemei, o Hashabia o Matitia, lelo pokira ile, tiabori eutaroto e papaai lenye Yedutum, laa ninye apa oibonisho to lwulul loo usin, eishooyo enashe neisis Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Heman naa: Bukia, o Matania, o Usiel o Shebuel, o Yerimot, o Hania, o Hanani, o Eliata, o Gidalti, o Romantieser, o Yoshbekasha, o Meloti, o Hotir, o Mahasiot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kulo pooki naa ilayiok le Heman, oladuaani lo laiguanani le Seer, terisioroto enkisiligata e Nkai pee eitaa ninye kitok, amu eishoo apa Enkai Heman ilayiok tomon oong'uan o ntoyie uni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii apa ninche pooki abori eutaroto e papaai lenye to sinkolio le nkaji e Nkai, too nkinantani, o nkai oo sinkoliotin, o lwululi loo usin, tenkaraki enkisiaayiare e nkaji e Nkai. Ore Asaf, o Yedutum, o Heman netii abori enkitanapata o laiguanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore esiana enye tenebo lelo alashera lenye, apa ooiteng'enaki te ranyakinoto o Laitoriani, lelo pooki arriyiak, naa iip are o ntomoni isiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neosh ninche enkukuo tenkaraki isiaaitin enye, kutiti o sapuki. Olaiteng'enani o loiteng'eni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedoiki enkukuo e dukuya Asaf lo lmarei le Yosef; nedoiki eniare Gedalia, ninye olalashera lenyena, o layiok lenyena pokira tomon oare; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedoiki ene uni Sakar o layiok lenyena o lalashera lenyena, pokira tomon oare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedoiki eniong'uan Isri, o layiok lenyena, o lalashera lenyena, pokira tomon oare; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedoiki ene imiet Natania, o layiok lenyena, o lalashera lenyena, pokira tomon oare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedoiki ene ile Bukia, o layiok lenyena, o lalashera lenyena pokira tomon oare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedoiki ene naapishana Yesherela, o layiok lenyena, o lalashera lenyena pokira tomon oare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
